      # prose on philosophy, decision theory and AI risk. neither writes code or
      # drives a tool loop, and lmca is the first facet here scored on the
      # QUALITY of an argument rather than on a right answer -- which is a
      # reason to leave it undiscounted, not a reason to guess a discount
      "epoch.dtbench", "epoch.lmca",
      "epoch.mystery_game_puzzles", "epoch.otis_mock_aime_2024_2025",
      "epoch.proofbench", "card.aime"]),

    ("following", False,
     "instruction following: whether it did what it was told, not how well",
     ["aa.ifbench", "card.ifbench", "card.ifeval"]),

    ("vision", False,
     "vision. the sweep quantized a text model's weights and never touched a "
